  "description": "The approach towards the Fey Court remains a wooded path rather than a visible palace. Pale stones lead up between several blue-green pools, each bordered by moss, rounded rocks and dense flowers. Enormous blue mushrooms lean over the left side, violet crystals rise above the upper path, and golden points of light hang among the trees. On the right, a slender waterfall and large peach-coloured flowers brighten the darker woodland. The lower foreground is full of curled ferns and small mushrooms; the upper centre opens into a hazy, brighter passage through the trees.",
